# Every screen from the title and back: the mode cards, the Daily Vein's
# rules sheet, Practice and Challenge lists, Journey, Leaderboards (this
# device's casual boards), How to play, Profile (a guest name saved),
# Settings (an option toggled); Escape backs
# out of the screens.
until 300 Daily Vein
frames 60
save title
click Daily Vein
until 60 ranked — same seed for everyone
expect Time limit
save daily-setup
click =Back
until 60 Assign. Upgrade.
frames 5
click =Play
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 5
click Constrained shifts
until 60 Challenges
frames 10
save challenges
key Escape 1
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 5
click Chase the boards
until 60 Leaderboards
expect Offline mode: boards are local to this device and marked casual.
expect No entries yet. Be the first.
save boards
click =All-time
frames 10
expect Casual board (no server validation).
click =Back
until 60 Choose your shift
frames 5
click =← Back
until 60 Assign. Upgrade.
frames 5
click =Journey
until 60 0 of 40 stages complete
save journey
click =← Back
until 60 Assign. Upgrade.
frames 5
click =How to play
until 60 The loop
expect Describe the current mine aloud
save help
key Escape 1
until 60 Assign. Upgrade.
frames 5
click =Profile
until 60 Mastery — level 1
save profile
click =Guest Prospector
frames 5
type {Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}{Backspace}Pit Boss
frames 5
click =Save
until 30 Name saved
key Escape 1
until 60 Playing as Pit Boss
frames 5
click =Settings
until 60 Text captions for sounds
save settings
click Camera sway
frames 5
frames 10
key Escape 1
until 60 Assign. Upgrade.
